# C++ conventions

- Standard: **C++23**
- Headers: `#pragma once` (not include guards)
- Namespaces: `eng` (engine), `arkanoid` (game); engine internals may use `eng::detail` / `eng::sfml`
- Classes: `CamelCase`; methods/vars: `camelCase`
- Interfaces: `FooI` suffix (`SceneI`, `RendererI`, `PlatformI`, `ClockI`)
- One primary type per `.hpp` / `.cpp` pair under the owning module

## Includes

- Public headers: `#include <eng/<module>/X.hpp>`, `#include <arkanoid/<sim|app>/X.hpp>`
- Same directory: quotes — `#include "Local.hpp"`
- Only `engine/sfml` and `games/arkanoid/main.cpp` may include `<SFML/...>`

## Style (match `.clang-format`)

- LLVM-based, 4 spaces, column 120, `PointerAlignment: Left`
- `SpaceBeforeParens: Never` → `if(`, `for(`, `while(`
- Braces on new lines (`BreakBeforeBraces` / `BraceWrapping`)
- Warnings as errors (`-Wall -Wextra -pedantic -Werror` / MSVC `/W4 /WX`)

After larger edits: `cmake --build --preset debug --target format` (Debug configure required).
